# Portfolio Project

## Stack

- **Runtime / PM**: Bun
- **Framework**: React 19 + Vite+ (`vp` CLI for dev, build, check, staged)
- **Routing**: TanStack Router (file-based routes in `src/routes/`)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 + Tailwind Variants (`tv`)
- **Linter / Formatter**: Oxlint / Oxfmt
- **Tests**: Vitest (colocated test files)

## Commands

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Dev server | `vp dev` |
| Build | `vp build` |
| Type-check + lint + test | `vp check` |
| Pre-commit (staged) | `vp staged` |
| Format | `vp fmt` |
| Tests | `bun run test` |
| Validate (all checks) | `bun run validate` |

## Git Hooks

Managed by Vite+ in `portfolio/.vite-hooks/`. The repo-local `core.hooksPath` points there.
Hook scripts `cd` into `portfolio/` before running (`cd "$(dirname "$(dirname "$0")")"`).

## CI/CD

GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`) → builds and deploys to GitHub Pages as SPA.
